{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15047","headline":"上巳日陪齐相公花楼宴 · 卢纶","name":"上巳日陪齐相公花楼宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锺陵暮春月，飞观延羣英。\n晨霞耀中轩，满席罗金琼。\n持杯凝远睇，触物结幽情。\n树色参差绿，湖光潋灩明。\n礼卑瞻绦帐，恩浃厕华缨。\n徒记山阴兴，祓禊乃爲荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15047.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15047","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}